          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "65536 was never chosen by anyone: nats.go's legacy pull path copies its own client-side subscription-channel capacity into the server config (",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "js.go",
                "type": "text",
                "marks": [
