              {
                "text": " stays unset, and now says so in code. The 2026-06-01 reaping valve exists for interest streams, where an abandoned durable pins every subsequent delivery for ALL consumers until the stream's maxAge. On limits retention an idle durable pins nothing and reaping it would only cost a cursor.",
