              {
                "text": " cover this migration's likeliest failure, an immutable-field disagreement against the live consumer. In exchange, Run recreates a consume loop that closes mid-run, as the old outer loop did. Closing the gap needs go-nuts to expose readiness from ",
                "type": "text"
