              },
              {
                "text": ".",
                "type": "text",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " The app no longer schedules the redelivery, so printing a delay would be a claim about someone else's config — true only while the two happen to agree, which is the drift this whole track exists to remove. Position in the ladder is what a responder can act on; the ladder itself is on the durable.",
                "type": "text"
