          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Give-up semantics changed, so this needs broker evidence rather than fake evidence. The existing unit tests answer what the handler ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "does",
                "type": "text",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
