              {
                "text": "; these answer what the broker does about it, which fakes cannot — they encode the same model as the code, so a belief held wrongly in both places is green.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "bulletList",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "text": "StoredConfigIsTheRenderedConfig",
                        "type": "text",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "bold"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "code"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " — the executable form of the table above: the real config through the real ",
                        "type": "text"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "CreateOrUpdateConsumer",
                        "type": "text",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "code"
                          }
