                        "type": "text",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "code"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " equals ",
                        "type": "text"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "AckWait",
                        "type": "text",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "code"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "text": ", so the test would pass whether redelivery followed the ladder or merely the ack timeout — pinning nothing. Gap tolerances are half the distance to the nearest rival explanation (~0 for a plain Nak, ",
                        "type": "text"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "rung1",
                        "type": "text",
                        "marks": [
